<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN THE SPANISH LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN THE SPANISH LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the</p>
<p>Spanish first division after Sunday's games:</p>
<p>22 - Ronaldo (Barcelona)</p>
<p>21 - Alfonso Perez (Real Betis)</p>
<p>19 - Davor Suker (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>15 - Raul Gonzalez (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>14 - Oli Alvarez (Oviedo)</p>
<p>13 - Jose Ziganda (Athletic Bilbao), Rivaldo (Deportivo Coruna)</p>
<p>12 - Luis Enrique Martinez (Barcelona), Predrag Mijatovic (Real</p>
<p>Madrid), Juan Eduardo Esnaider (Atletico Madrid), Corentin</p>
<p>Martins (Deportivo Coruna), Victor Fernandez (Valladolid)</p>
<p>11 - Julen Guerrero (Athletic Bilbao), Christopher Ohen</p>
<p>(Compostela)</p>
</text>
